  "prefLabel": "Puc 1602.13 Special contract",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1602.13 “Special contract” means rates and charges, including terms and conditions, covering service rendered under prices and conditions which vary from those contained in the filed tariff. The term does not include any contract that applies to service furnished in accordance with an existing tariff.\n\nSource. #14030, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 1602.06)",
